{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "meta"
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "string": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "array": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "uniqueItems": true
    },
    "array-items-string": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "array-items-text": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "object"
            ],
            "if": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "then": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
            },
            "else": {
              "required": [
                "cmd",
                "desc"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "cmd": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
                },
                "desc": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "name": {
      "title": "命令名称",
      "markdownDescription": "它应该是一个完整的名称，简写应该放在 `alias` 中",
      "examples": [
        ""
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "pattern": " "
          },
          "then": {
            "pattern": "(^\".+\"$)|(^'.+'$)",
            "errorMessage": "如果需要空格，请使用 \" 或 ' 包裹，例如: 'hello world'"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "alias": {
      "title": "命令别名",
      "markdownDescription": "它通常是一个简写名称，完整的名称应该使用 `name` 定义",
      "examples": [
        []
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-string"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "if": {
              "pattern": " "
            },
            "then": {
              "pattern": "(^\".+\"$)|(^'.+'$)",
              "errorMessage": "如果需要空格，请使用 \" 或 ' 包裹，例如: 'hello world'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "tip": {
      "markdownDescription": "补全项的描述信息（显示为 `[Description]` 部分）。\n- `usage` 和 `example` 字段分别存放用法和示例。\n- 这里有一个示例:\n```json\n  \"tip\": [\n    \"Add file changes to the index.\"\n  ]\n  ```",
      "examples": [
        []
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-string"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "contains": {
              "pattern": "[\\r\\n]"
            }
          },
          "errorMessage": "数组中的每个项会在显示时末尾自动添加换行符，因此不允许使用换行符"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "not": {
              "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
            },
            "errorMessage": "tip: 中英之间需空格"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "repeat": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "该补全项的最大重复次数。",
      "minimum": 1,
      "examples": [
        1,
        2,
        3,
        4,
        5,
        99
      ]
    },
    "usage": {
      "markdownDescription": "补全项的用法行（显示为 `[Usage]` 部分）。\n- 可选; 不填则不显示用法部分。\n- 每项可以是纯字符串，或对象 `{ \"cmd\": ..., \"desc\": ... }`——对象形式下 **`cmd` 和 `desc` 都必须提供**（没有解释时直接用纯字符串）。\n- 示例:\n```json\n  \"usage\": [\"-r, --revisions <REVSETS>\", { \"cmd\": \"add|install <APP>\", \"desc\": \"安装一个包\" }]\n```",
      "examples": [
        []
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-text"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "not": {
                  "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                },
                "errorMessage": "usage: 中英之间需空格"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "cmd": {
                    "not": {
                      "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                    }
                  },
                  "desc": {
                    "not": {
                      "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "example": {
      "markdownDescription": "补全项的示例行（显示为 `[Example]` 部分）。\n- 可选; 不填则不显示示例部分。\n- 每项可以是纯字符串，或对象 `{ \"cmd\": ..., \"desc\": ... }`——对象形式下 **`cmd` 和 `desc` 都必须提供**（没有解释时直接用纯字符串）。\n- 示例:\n```json\n  \"example\": [\"-r '@-'\", { \"cmd\": \"d demo.zip *.bak -r\", \"desc\": \"删除所有 bak 文件\" }]\n```",
      "examples": [
        []
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-text"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "not": {
                  "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                },
                "errorMessage": "example: 中英之间需空格"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "cmd": {
                    "not": {
                      "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                    }
                  },
                  "desc": {
                    "not": {
                      "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "item": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/name"
        },
        "alias": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/alias"
        },
        "tip": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/tip"
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/usage"
        },
        "example": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/example"
        },
        "repeat": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/repeat"
        },
        "next": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/next-for-option"
        },
        "option": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/option"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "next-item": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/name"
        },
        "alias": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/alias"
        },
        "tip": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/tip"
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/usage"
        },
        "example": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/example"
        },
        "next": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/next"
        },
        "option": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/option"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "next": {
      "markdownDescription": "下一个子命令补全（**仅命令**）\n- 必须是**非空数组**——命令要么有下一层（其子命令），要么没有\n- 命令的参数值由 `usage` 占位符表达，不用 `next`\n- 数组中的项会自动添加到补全中",
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/next-item"
      }
    },
    "next-for-option": {
      "markdownDescription": "选项的下一级补全（候选值）\n- 必须是**数组**\n- **非空**数组列出静态候选值（选中后记为选项的 `value`；候选外的词为 `unknown`）\n- **空**数组 `[]` 表示\"无静态候选\"",
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/next-item"
      }
    },
    "require_next": {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "usage": {
            "contains": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[^#]*<[^<>]*>"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "usage"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "next"
        ]
      }
    },
    "option": {
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "minItems": 1,
      "markdownDescription": "下一个选项类补全\n - 通常以 `-` 或 `--` 开头\n - 例如 `--list`",
      "items": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/item"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/require_next"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "meta": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "补全命令的相关信息",
      "required": [
        "url",
        "description"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "url": {
          "description": "命令的主页或仓库地址",
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
            },
            {
              "pattern": "^https?://",
              "errorMessage": "它必须是一个有效的 http/https URL"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": {
          "description": "命令的描述",
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-string"
            },
            {
              "not": {
                "contains": {
                  "pattern": "\\n"
                }
              },
              "errorMessage": "数组中的每个项会在显示时末尾自动添加换行符，因此不允许使用换行符"
            },
            {
              "items": {
                "not": {
                  "pattern": "[\\u4e00-\\u9fff][A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z][\\u4e00-\\u9fff]"
                },
                "errorMessage": "meta.description: 中英之间需空格"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "next": {
      "description": "根命令的子命令补全",
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/next-item"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "option": {
      "markdownDescription": "根命令的选项类补全",
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/item"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/require_next"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "global_option": {
      "markdownDescription": "全局的选项类补全\n- 任何情况下触发补全，都会显示它们\n- 除非你已经使用过它或它的别名了",
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/item"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/require_next"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "config": {
      "description": "补全的特殊配置项",
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
        },
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "value",
              "tip"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "description": "配置项的名称",
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/string"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "value": {
                "description": "配置项的默认值",
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "number"
                ]
              },
              "values": {
                "markdownDescription": "配置项的可选值\n- 这里填写的值会在触发命令补全时显示\n - 假设命令补全是 `xxx`，配置项名称是 `enable_xxx`\n - 则当你输入 `psc completion xxx enable_xxx` 后触发补全，会获取 `values` 数组中的值，并显示在补全列表中",
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "items": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "number"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/array"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "tip": {
                "description": "配置项的提示信息",
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/array-items-string"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "pattern": "^(enable|disable)"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "value": {
                  "enum": [
                    0,
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "values": {
                  "const": [
                    0,
                    1
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "info": {
      "markdownDescription": "一些额外的信息，hooks 可通过 `psc.manifest.info` 访问",
      "type": "object",
      "minProperties": 1
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}